<title>USA: Sun Co sees no refinery work in Northeast in Q2.</title>
<headline>Sun Co sees no refinery work in Northeast in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Co Inc said there were no planned maintenance turnarounds scheduled at its Philadelphia and Marcus Hook, Pennsylvania refineries during the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The Philadelphia-based Sun operates five domestic refineries with 770,000 barrels per day of crude oil processing capacity.</p>
<p>-- New York Energy Desk + 1 212 859 1620</p>
